source:
Usage: nmcli general status { help }

Show overall status of NetworkManager.
'status' is the default action, which means 'nmcli gen' calls 'nmcli gen status'

target:
Användning: nmcli general status { help }

Visar allmän status för Nätverkshanteraren.
”status” är standardåtgärden, vilket betyder att ”nmcli gen” anropar ”nmcli gen status”

source:
Available shapes:
  2  - default output;
  4  - one line for each keycode;
  8  - one line for each (modifier,keycode) pair;
  16 - one line for each keycode until 1st hole.

target:
